Haaye Kamar Todh Gaye Bhai Hume Chodhe Gaye<br>
Sogaye Kudh Naher Par Rota Hume Chodh Gaye<br>
<br>
1.Kis Ke Sahare Jeeye Ashk Kahan Tak Peeye<br>
Chak Jigar Hogaya Kaise Gijar Ku Seeye<br>
Mout Ka Saman Hai Lab Pe Meri Jaan Hai Aaiye Baba Ali<br>
<br>
2.Bole Imam-e-Zaman Dard Se Dil Hai Tapa<br>
 Tu Hi Baata Alkhama Bhai Mera Hai Kahan<br>
 Hogaya Kaise Ghazab Paou Kahan Usku Ab Aaiye Maa Fatima<br>
 <br>
3.Mash-o &ndash;Alam Aagaye Ap Kahan Rehgaye<br>
Tukdhe Jigar Ke Mere Ashkou Me Sab Bhegaye<br>
Dil Ke Bhot Pass They Wo Tu Meri Aas Hai They Aaiye Bhai Hasan<br>
<br>
4.Wo Toh Alamdar They Kitne Wafadar They<br>
Wo Toh Meri Fouj Ke Syed-o-Sardar They<br>
Jaan-e-Sipah-e-Khuda Khugaya Bhai Mera Jaagiye Zain-Ul-Aba
